  "fixes": {
    "fixed_reservation_boundary": "The boundary is derived only from game/client viewport and requested scale, independent of queue length, candidate count and tab. Queue height expands upward. Renderer rectangle coordinates, direct strokes and hit tests share pointY, with rounding relative to the fixed boundary. Size-dependent values retain y as a scaled length.",
    "world_identity": "serviceCommandQueue passes the consumed Item into send. Original PID/match/type-list hash remain immutable across readSnapshot; changed PID/match/connection or expired intent returns reservation -13 before requeue/publication. Busy requeue preserves original created time. Same-match ready/busy controls remain functional.",
    "broker_pending": "runtimeAvailable and assistIdentity ERROR_IO_PENDING show connecting and retry after 75ms without incrementing failure attempts or blocking. Identity check precedes mapping allocation so pending does not repeatedly create/release a mapping. If install returns no subscription plus ERROR_IO_PENDING while an old Target retires, release only this unleased Assist mapping, restore the prior attempt count and retry after 75ms; no permanent block or failure backoff."
  },
